{
  "lessonId": "L2M1L4",
  "title": "Emilia-Romagna 艾米利亞-羅馬涅",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e74c3c 0%,#c0392b 100%)'><h1>🍾 Emilia-Romagna</h1><p class='subtitle'>Lambrusco 氣泡酒與美食天堂</p></section><section class='slide map-slide'><div class='map-slide-container'><div id='emilia-map' class='emilia-region-map'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.4rem;border-bottom:3px solid #e74c3c;padding-bottom:10px;'>📍 Emilia-Romagna 產區地圖</h3><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>大區邊界</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;border:3px solid #e74c3c;margin-right:10px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Emilia-Romagna 大區</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>Lambrusco 氣泡紅酒 🍾</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#f39c12;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>S級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Lambrusco di Sorbara DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e74c3c;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>A級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Lambrusco Grasparossa DOC</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e67e22;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>A級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Reggiano DOC</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>白酒與紅酒 🍷</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#3498db;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>B級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Romagna Albana DOCG（白酒）</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#5dade2;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>B級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Pignoletto DOCG（白酒）</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#85c1e9;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>B級</span><span style='color:#bdc3c7;margin-left:10px;font-size:0.9rem;'>Romagna DOC（Sangiovese）</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>重要城市</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:12px;height:12px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid white;margin-right:10px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Bologna, Modena, Parma, Reggio Emilia</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>操作提示</h4><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 滑鼠懸停查看產區名稱</p><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 點擊產區查看詳細資訊</p><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 點擊城市標記查看說明</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ 義大利的美食首都</h2><div class='region-overview'><div class='overview-text'><p>Emilia-Romagna 橫跨義大利北部，以<strong>Lambrusco 氣泡紅酒</strong>、<strong>Parmigiano-Reggiano 起司</strong>、<strong>Parma 火腿</strong>和<strong>Balsamic 醋</strong>聞名世界。</p></div><div class='famous-foods'><h4>🧀 世界級美食</h4><div class='food-grid'><div class='food-item'>🧀 Parmigiano-Reggiano</div><div class='food-item'>🥓 Prosciutto di Parma</div><div class='food-item'>🥫 Modena Balsamic 醋</div><div class='food-item'>🍝 Tagliatelle al Ragù（肉醬麵）</div><div class='food-item'>🥩 Mortadella 香腸</div><div class='food-item'>🫓 Piadina 薄餅</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍾 Lambrusco - 被誤解的氣泡紅酒</h2><div class='lambrusco-section'><div class='lambrusco-intro'><h3>🍷 Lambrusco 的真相</h3><p>Lambrusco 因1970-80 年代的<strong>甜型廉價出口酒</strong>而名聲受損，但其實<strong>真正的 Lambrusco 是不甜、優質、複雜</strong>的氣泡紅酒。</p></div><div class='lambrusco-types'><div class='type-card dry'><h4>🍷 Secco（不甜）</h4><p class='type-desc'>現代高品質 Lambrusco 主流</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、果香、單寧柔順</p><p><strong>殘糖：</strong>&lt; 15 g/L</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>義式料理、油炸食物、起司</p></div><div class='type-card semi-dry'><h4>🍷 Amabile（微甜）</h4><p class='type-desc'>傳統風格</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>果香豐富、易飲</p><p><strong>殘糖：</strong>15-50 g/L</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>BBQ、辣食</p></div><div class='type-card sweet'><h4>🍷 Dolce（甜型）</h4><p class='type-desc'>出口市場版本</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>甜美、葡萄汁風味</p><p><strong>殘糖：</strong>&gt; 50 g/L</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>甜點、水果</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Lambrusco 三大 DOC</h2><div class='lambrusco-docs'><div class='doc-item top'><div class='doc-rank'>#1</div><h3>Lambrusco di Sorbara DOC</h3><div class='doc-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Modena 省</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Lambrusco di Sorbara（100%）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>最優雅、酒體最輕、玫瑰粉紅色</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、覆盆莓、紫羅蘭、草本</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>高酸度、清爽、細膩氣泡</p></div></div><div class='doc-item'><div class='doc-rank'>#2</div><h3>Lambrusco Grasparossa di Castelvetro DOC</h3><div class='doc-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Modena 省南部丘陵</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Lambrusco Grasparossa（85%+）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>最濃郁、酒體最飽滿、深紫紅色</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑莓、李子、紫羅蘭、巧克力</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>單寧較高、結構感強</p></div></div><div class='doc-item'><div class='doc-rank'>#3</div><h3>Reggiano Lambrusco DOC</h3><div class='doc-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Reggio Emilia 省</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>多種 Lambrusco 混釀</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>平衡型、寶石紅色</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅色水果、香料、花香</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>產量大、性價比高</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⚪ Emilia-Romagna 白葡萄酒</h2><div class='white-wines-section'><div class='white-wine-card'><h3>Albana di Romagna DOCG</h3><p class='doc-badge'>義大利第一個白酒 DOCG（1987）</p><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Albana（100%）</p><p><strong>類型：</strong>不甜 Secco / 微甜 Amabile / 甜型 Passito</p><p><strong>風格（Secco）：</strong>杏桃、白桃、杏仁、中等酒體</p><p><strong>風格（Passito）：</strong>蜂蜜、杏桃乾、堅果、甜美</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>Secco 配魚、Passito 配甜點</p></div></div><div class='white-wine-card'><h3>Pignoletto DOC / DOCG</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>品種：</strong>Pignoletto（Grechetto Gentile）</p><p><strong>類型：</strong>靜態酒 / Frizzante 微氣泡 / Spumante 氣泡酒</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>白花、青蘋果、杏仁、清爽</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Bologna 地區的日常白酒</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Sangiovese di Romagna DOC</h2><div class='sangiovese-romagna'><div class='sr-intro'><h3>🍇 不同於 Tuscany 的 Sangiovese</h3><p>Romagna（羅馬涅）產區的 Sangiovese 風格與 Tuscany 不同：<strong>更果香、更柔順、更易飲</strong>，適合年輕時飲用。</p></div><div class='sr-comparison'><table><tr><th>特徵</th><th>Sangiovese di Romagna</th><th>Chianti / Brunello</th></tr><tr><td><strong>風格</strong></td><td>果香豐富、柔順</td><td>結構感強、單寧高</td></tr><tr><td><strong>單寧</strong></td><td>中等、柔順</td><td>高、堅實</td></tr><tr><td><strong>適飲期</strong></td><td>年輕時（2-5 年）</td><td>陳年後（5-20 年）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酒精度</strong></td><td>12-13%</td><td>13-14.5%</td></tr><tr><td><strong>價格</strong></td><td>€-€€</td><td>€€-€€€€</td></tr></table></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🧀 Lambrusco 與 Emilia 美食配對</h2><div class='food-pairing-section'><div class='pairing-philosophy'><h3>💡 為什麼 Lambrusco 是 Emilia 料理的完美搭檔？</h3><div class='reasons'><div class='reason'><strong>1. 高酸度</strong> - 切割油膩的起司和肉類</div><div class='reason'><strong>2. 氣泡</strong> - 清爽口腔，去除油脂</div><div class='reason'><strong>3. 低酒精</strong> - 不會壓過料理風味</div><div class='reason'><strong>4. 單寧柔順</strong> - 與起司不衝突</div></div></div><div class='classic-pairings'><h4>🍽️ 經典配對</h4><div class='pairing-grid'><div class='pairing-card'><h5>Lambrusco Secco</h5><ul><li>🧀 Parmigiano-Reggiano（36個月陳年）</li><li>🥓 Prosciutto di Parma 生火腿</li><li>🍝 Tagliatelle al Ragù（波隆那肉醬麵）</li><li>🥩 Cotechino 香腸配扁豆</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h5>Lambrusco Grasparossa</h5><ul><li>🥩 Zampone（豬腳香腸）</li><li>🍖 烤紅肉</li><li>🧀 陳年 Parmigiano</li><li>🍕 厚餅 Pizza</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h5>Lambrusco di Sorbara</h5><ul><li>🐟 炸海鮮</li><li>🥗 沙拉</li><li>🍤 蝦類料理</li><li>🫓 Piadina 薄餅</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Emilia-Romagna 是義大利的美食首都</div><div class='point'>✓ Lambrusco 的優質版本是不甜、清爽的氣泡紅酒</div><div class='point'>✓ Lambrusco di Sorbara 最優雅，Grasparossa 最濃郁</div><div class='point'>✓ Albana di Romagna 是義大利第一個白酒 DOCG</div><div class='point'>✓ Lambrusco 與 Emilia 料理（起司、火腿）完美配對</div><div class='point'>✓ Sangiovese di Romagna 比 Tuscany 版本更果香柔順</div></div></section></div><style>.region-overview{display:grid;gap:20px}.overview-text p{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 20px}.famous-foods h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.3rem}.food-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.food-item{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#fff);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50;border-left:4px solid #e74c3c}.lambrusco-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.lambrusco-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#fce4ec);border-radius:10px}.lambrusco-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.5rem}.lambrusco-intro p{margin:0;fon